 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Grandpa, a million people open",
   "s": 0,
   "e": 1.42,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "the same website at once.",
   "s": 1.48,
   "e": 2.82,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Why doesn't it die?",
   "s": 2.88,
   "e": 3.96,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "One computer would. Instantly.",
   "s": 4.02,
   "e": 6.08,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So it's not one computer?",
   "s": 6.14,
   "e": 7.52,
   "line": 3,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Hundreds. All running the same",
   "s": 7.58,
   "e": 9.36,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "copy of the site.",
   "s": 9.42,
   "e": 10.42,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "But my phone only",
   "s": 10.48,
   "e": 11.2,
   "line": 5,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "knocks on one door.",
   "s": 11.26,
   "e": 12.46,
   "line": 5,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Yes. A man stands",
   "s": 12.52,
   "e": 14.02,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "at that door.",
   "s": 14.08,
   "e": 15.06,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Like the host at",
   "s": 15.12,
   "e": 15.96,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "a busy restaurant.",
   "s": 16.02,
   "e": 17.15,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "What does he do?",
   "s": 17.24,
   "e": 18.06,
   "line": 7,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "He points.",
   "s": 18.12,
   "e": 18.76,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "You, table one.",
   "s": 18.82,
   "e": 19.86,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "You, table two.",
   "s": 19.92,
   "e": 21,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Round and round.",
   "s": 21.06,
   "e": 21.98,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And if table two is slow?",
   "s": 22.04,
   "e": 23.52,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the next guest goes",
   "s": 23.58,
   "e": 24.52,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "to the emptiest table.",
   "s": 24.58,
   "e": 25.72,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "He keeps count.",
   "s": 25.78,
   "e": 26.62,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "What if a table just breaks?",
   "s": 26.68,
   "e": 28.06,
   "line": 11,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "He checks every few seconds.",
   "s": 28.12,
   "e": 29.61,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "A broken one gets no guests.",
   "s": 29.74,
   "e": 31.81,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody notices.",
   "s": 32.04,
   "e": 33.11,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Wait. So the host is the",
   "s": 33.3,
   "e": 34.8,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "one thing that can't break?",
   "s": 34.86,
   "e": 36.34,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Good catch.",
   "s": 36.4,
   "e": 37.31,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So there are two of them.",
   "s": 37.56,
   "e": 38.86,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Two hosts.",
   "s": 38.92,
   "e": 39.83,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then who points people",
   "s": 40.08,
   "e": 40.94,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "to the hosts?",
   "s": 41,
   "e": 41.84,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Another list.",
   "s": 41.9,
   "e": 42.93,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "That one is public.",
   "s": 43.14,
   "e": 44.32,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And who checks that one?",
   "s": 44.38,
   "e": 45.89,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Don't. It's hosts all",
   "s": 46.84,
   "e": 48.66,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "the way up.",
   "s": 48.72,
   "e": 49.55,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  }
 ],
